<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suffrāgo</span></b> ,
			āvi, 1, v. a., = suffragor.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>to
				favor</i>, <i>support</i>, <i>vote
				for</i>, Sisenn. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 468,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>To agree with</i>, Pomp. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Non. 468, 7</span></i> (Com. Fragm. 106
			Rib.).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>To proceed favorably</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 3</span></i>
			 Esd. 6, 10.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
